OL,3,GNEWSAExplosives team called to rail
OL,4,Aline as trains disrupted
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreater Anglia trains between Norwich
OL,7,Fand Ely, including those running to
OL,8,FStansted Airport via Cambridge, were
OL,9,Fcancelled before services were later
OL,10,Fresumed.
